  {
   "id": "f812bdfcc6f5",
   "unit_id": "f812bdfcc6f5ea9dc40322d9176829c27c43b97e3fd3aedc71e4fe7e949ea0e3",
   "revision_key": "d1d9c3aaeb49e6534d9e9c626701c22d086b1f20ad4da92d30bf88a30510421c",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 4119,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/alchemist-last-hope.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Oh, easy. You get a swig of each brew, of course. They'll put hair on your chest, and possibly your eyelids and fingernails. And, if your aid proves the deciding factor, then I've got a real treat for you: perhaps the last Taint of Purging left in Maj'Eyal.",
   "target": "很简单，每份佳酿我都会分你一口。喝下这些佳酿会让你长出胸毛，说不定连眼皮和指甲上都会长。而且，要是你的帮助能起决定性作用的话，我还会额外给你一件真正的宝物：也许是马基·埃亚尔仅存的最后一枚“污印：清除”哦。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/alchemist-last-hope.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    153
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "59bc41d904e9",
   "unit_id": "59bc41d904e964c317d540d39b60f6ed32bbc9ed52e43d5626a38774e5a77fc9",
   "revision_key": "b45ad42864e51911896a7e90e9dd73fac80da21f13f4755b31df69fdbff49c83",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 4152,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/alchemist-last-hope.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*The dwarf finally returns with a vial and a small pouch.*#WHITE#\nI put a bit of the good stuff in this one, though it won't do you any favors tomorrow morning. And careful with that Taint of Purging, especially if the wife answers the door the next time you knock. Har!",
   "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*那个矮人终于回来了，手里拿着一个药瓶和一个小袋子。*#WHITE#\n我往这瓶里加了点好料，不过明早可有你受的。还要当心那枚“污印：清除”，特别是下次你敲门时要是我老婆来开门。哈！",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/alchemist-last-hope.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    405
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
